  "howToUse": "Each key under 'assets' maps one generated image or video to its ready-to-post caption. Automation should join on 'assetPath' (relative to the koolestpro-cowork-v2 project root) or on the key. 'status' tracks whether that asset+caption pairing has been posted; it is separate from the pipeline item's status in ridwan_content_system_updated.html, which never reaches 'Published'. MOULT is a concept brand with no pre-written caption library; this file is that library, started on the first MOULT Template Showcase run (2026-10-17).",
