        "#shopify",
        "#ecommerce",
        "#webdesign",
        "#homepage"
      ],
      "caption": "Built a homepage for MOULT, a pet grooming brand I made up. It's a concept build, not a client.\n\nThe store sells one thing: a slicker brush that drops the fur in a single clump when you press a button. So the homepage has one job, getting a dog owner who is tired of lint rollers to that button.\n\nHow I laid it out:\n✅ the headline sells the clean sofa before it mentions the brush\n✅ the story section names the annoying part, cleaning the brush itself\n✅ the product card comes third, with the price and one button\n✅ dogs, cats and the clean-up each get a card, then reviews\n\nDesktop and mobile run in the same order. I didn't drop a section for the small screen.\n\nNeed a store like this built? Start here: koolestpro.com/services/page-build",
      "captionKey": "TS-MOULT-HP01-COVER-VID",
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null
    },
