      ],
      "caption": "The whole MOULT homepage, split into two columns.\n\nLeft column makes the case: the sofa promise, the story about brushes that won't let go of fur, then the product and price.\n\nRight column answers \"will it work on my pet\". Dogs, cats, the clean-up, reviews, the three promises, the newsletter.\n\nI wanted the page to answer questions in the order a doubtful pet owner would ask them. Concept build for a brand I made up.",
